    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικίδνημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spread over</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακοῖς
				ἐπικίδνατε θυμόν</span>
			<i>spread</i> a brave spirit <i>over</i> your ills, Orac. ap.
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.140
			</span></i>:—in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always 
				Pass.
			 (only in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ ἐπικίδναται ἆιαν</span>
			<i>is spread over</i> the earth, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.850
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.978
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσον τ᾽ ἐπικίδναται
			ἠώς</span> far as the morning light <i>is</i>
			<i>spread</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				7.451
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				458
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεκίδνατο οὐρανὸν ἄστρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					5.347
				</span></i>
			.</div>
